<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-GRIQUA WEST 144-3 AT TEA AGAINST WPROVINCE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-GRIQUA WEST 144-3 AT TEA AGAINST WPROVINCE.</headline>
<dateline>KIMBERLEY 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griqualand West were 144 for three from 58 overs at tea on the first day of the four-day Supersport Series match against Western Province in Kimberley on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Griqualand West 144-3 (Martyn Gidley 75 not out) against Western Province.</p>
